jets(ZZ,RingMap) -- the jets of a homomorphism of rings
*******************************************************

  * Function: *note jets: jets,
  * Usage: 
        jets (n,f)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * f, a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Projective: jets_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmProjective=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ...,
        default value false, Option for jets
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, obtained by applying the n-th
        jets functor to f

Description
===========

This function is provided by the package *note Jets: Top,.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                                                    |
|                                                                      |
|o1 = R                                                                |
|                                                                      |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = QQ[t]                                                        |
|                                                                      |
|o2 = S                                                                |
|                                                                      |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = map(S,R,{t,t^2,t^3})                                         |
|                                                                      |
|                     2   3                                            |
|o3 = map (S, R, {t, t , t })                                          |
|                                                                      |
|o3 : RingMap S <-- R                                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Jf = jets(2,f);                                                  |
|                                                                      |
|o4 : RingMap QQ[t0][t1][t2] <-- QQ[x0, y0, z0][x1, y1, z1][x2, y2, z2]|
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : matrix Jf                                                        |
|                                                                      |
|o5 = | t2 2t0t2+t1^2 3t0^2t2+3t0t1^2 t1 2t0t1 3t0^2t1 t0 t0^2 t0^3 |  |
|                                                                      |
|                            1                     9                   |
|o5 : Matrix (QQ[t0][t1][t2])  <-- (QQ[t0][t1][t2])                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+

This function can also be applied when the source and/or the target of the ring
homomorphism are quotients of a polynomial ring

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : I = ideal(y-x^2,z-x^3)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|               2         3                                                   |
|o6 = ideal (- x  + y, - x  + z)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Q = R/I                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : g = map(S,Q,{t,t^2,t^3})                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                     2   3                                                   |
|o8 = map (S, Q, {t, t , t })                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : RingMap S <-- Q                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : isWellDefined g                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : Jg = jets(2,g);                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
