*******************************************************

  * Function: *note jets: jets,
  * Usage: 
        jets (n,V)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * V, an *note affine variety: (Varieties)AffineVariety,, 
