      * *note Projective: jets_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmProjective=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ...,
        default value false, Option for jets
  * Outputs:
      * a *note variety: (Varieties)Variety,, an *note AffineVariety:
        (Varieties)AffineVariety, or a *note ProjectiveVariety:
        (Varieties)ProjectiveVariety,

Description
===========

Returns the jets of an *note AffineVariety: (Varieties)AffineVariety, as an
*note AffineVariety: (Varieties)AffineVariety,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(y^2-x^2*(x+1))                                                |
|                                                                             |
|              3    2    2                                                    |
|o2 = ideal(- x  - x  + y )                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = Spec(R/I)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : AffineVariety                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : jets(2,A)                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|         /                                   QQ[x0, y0][x1, y1][x2, y2]      |
|o4 = Spec|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         |       2                                  2     2        2         |
|         \((- 3x0  - 2x0)x2 + 2y0*y2 + (- 3x0 - 1)x1  + y1 , (- 3x0  - 2x0)x1|
|                                                                             |
|o4 : AffineVariety                                                           |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                             \                                               |
|-----------------------------|                                               |
|               3     2     2 |                                               |
| + 2y0*y1, - x0  - x0  + y0 )/                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

If *note jets(...,Projective=>...):
jets_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmProjective=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, is set to true, then jets are
computed with the grading introduced in Proposition 6.6 (c) of P. Vojta, Jets
via Hasse-Schmidt Derivations (see https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0407113 ), and
the function returns a *note ProjectiveVariety: (Varieties)ProjectiveVariety,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : jets(2,A,Projective=>true)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|         /                                   QQ[x0, y0][x1, y1][x2, y2]      |
|o5 = Proj|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         |       2                                  2     2        2         |
|         \((- 3x0  - 2x0)x2 + 2y0*y2 + (- 3x0 - 1)x1  + y1 , (- 3x0  - 2x0)x1|
|                                                                             |
|o5 : ProjectiveVariety                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                             \                                               |
|-----------------------------|                                               |
|               3     2     2 |                                               |
| + 2y0*y1, - x0  - x0  + y0 )/                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

With Projective=>true the jet variables of order zero have degree 0, therefore
no heft vector exist for the ambient ring of the jets. As a result, certain
computations will not be supported, and others may run more slowly. See *note
heft vectors: (Macaulay2Doc)heft vectors, for more information.

Note: jets of projective varieties are currently not implemented.



